    A1 LR +0.0086
    A3 RF -0.0066
    A5 HGB -0.0020

A9 duplicate sensitivity (A9 minus A6, PR-AUC): +0.0077
A shift of a few thousandths means the duplicate profiles were not inflating the headline result;
a large negative shift would mean the original figure was partly memorisation.
